CONTRIBUTING TO KHAN A.I.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

We welcome contributions from the community! If you have ideas, improvements,
bug fixes, or new features you'd like to add to Khan A.I., here's how you can
contribute:

HOW TO CONTRIBUTE:
──────────────────

1. FORK THE REPOSITORY
   Go to the GitHub repository and click the "Fork" button in the top right
   corner. This creates your own copy of the project.

2. CLONE YOUR FORK
   git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/khan-ai-assistant-fyp.git
   cd khan-ai-assistant-fyp

3. CREATE A NEW BRANCH
   Always create a new branch for your changes — never work directly on main:
   git checkout -b feature/your-feature-name

4. MAKE YOUR CHANGES
   Implement your improvement, bug fix, or new feature. Make sure your code
   is clean, well-commented, and follows the existing code style.

5. TEST YOUR CHANGES
   Run the project locally and make sure everything works correctly:
   python main.py          (Desktop mode)
   python main.py --web    (Web mode)

6. COMMIT YOUR CHANGES
   Write a clear and descriptive commit message:
   git add .
   git commit -m "feat: describe what you added or changed"

7. PUSH TO YOUR FORK
   git push origin feature/your-feature-name

8. OPEN A PULL REQUEST
   Go to the original repository on GitHub and click "New Pull Request".
   Select your branch and describe your changes clearly. The maintainer
   (Asad Abbas) will review your contribution and merge it if it looks good!

WHAT KIND OF CONTRIBUTIONS ARE WELCOME:
────────────────────────────────────────

  ✅  New AI features or integrations
  ✅  UI/UX improvements and new themes
  ✅  Bug fixes and performance improvements
  ✅  Support for new languages
  ✅  Better automation capabilities
  ✅  Documentation improvements
  ✅  Mobile/web enhancements
  ✅  Sound design improvements
  ✅  Code refactoring and cleanup

CONTRIBUTION GUIDELINES:
─────────────────────────

  • Be respectful and professional in all interactions
  • Write clear commit messages describing what changed and why
  • Keep pull requests focused — one feature or fix per PR
  • Add comments to your code so others can understand it
  • Do not commit API keys, .env files, or sensitive information
  • Test your changes before submitting a pull request

REPORTING BUGS OR SUGGESTING FEATURES:
───────────────────────────────────────

  If you find a bug or have a feature request, open an Issue on GitHub:
  https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/khan-ai-assistant-fyp/issues

  When reporting a bug, please include:
  • What you were doing when the bug occurred
  • What you expected to happen
  • What actually happened
  • Your operating system and Python version
  • Any error messages from the terminal

CONTACT:
────────

  If you have any questions or want to discuss an idea before implementing it,
  feel free to reach out through GitHub Issues or open a Discussion.

  Developer : Asad Abbas
  GitHub    : https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME

  We appreciate every contribution, no matter how small.
  Thank you for helping make Khan A.I. better! 🚀

